tals are coming from your skin. \ud83d\ude32 ( No mechanical difference, as I understood podcast. )</li> <li>In the settting there is a big <b>Magical Steampunk</b> and science elements also! ( Quote from preview -'<i>When the people of Everend speak of technology, thus, they mean steam harnessed by spirits, intricate brass coils catching the essence of the elements, and crystal cogs powered by magic.'</i>)</li> <li>Arts - <b>Technique skills</b>: Many require Momentum - <i><b>Desperation Ability</b></i> ( your <i>Final Fantasy</i>-like Limit Breaks) - That needs O ( ZERO ) Momentum in the pool! R<i><b>eadiness Abilities</b></i> - that needs 'AT Least this' number of Momentum.</li> <li><b>Magic</b> - Main Four <i>Pillars</i> ( Schools of Magic ) are - <b>Anima</b> is the magic of the body and Soul, Cognition is the magic of the mind and others, <b>Elementalism</b> is the magic of the land and elements, and <b>Transmutation</b> is the magic of change and manipulating magic itself.</li> <li>One of 3 blocks of Pillar is you <b>Keystone</b> - 3 different cooldowns types on them: <b>Instinct</b> cast every single <i><b>round</b></i>, <b>Elevated</b> - cast only once a <b><i>scene</i></b>, and <b>Iconic </b>- cast once a <b><i>session</i></b>. You can refresh Elevated and Iconic by spending <i><b>Energy</b></i>. For <b>Keystone</b>, you can refresh Iconic and Elevated refresh them for free once per session.( Choose Keystone by looking what you want to cast twice per session. )</li> </ul><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/1fTxb8gqMIlxZUDeHO4iz2?si=XXVngkQDRmm-RombTqTdnQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/1fTxb8gqMIlxZUDeHO4iz2?si=XXVngkQDRmm-RombTqTdnQ\" tar